  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Engineering solutions for water and sustainability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the scientific and engineering knowledge and capacities on water resources in the Asia Pacific region is paramount for evidence-based decisions in addressing sustainably the growing complex water challenges. A shift away from the supply-oriented hard path is possible and necessary. Central to this change will be a transition to a focus on demand, efficiency, and reuse. These include water engineering technologies to transform industries and allow people to use water more sustainably.</narrative>
  </description>
